          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tokerite ŋinituŋanan papa keŋ ka toto keŋ, lopite ŋolo ikicikia Ekapolon Akuj kus iyes, ikotere tolalata ŋirwa ŋulu iboiyoto iyes, ido tomam ŋace aneni kus anakwap a ŋina ikiini Ekapolon Akuj kus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
